  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Incoming visit green hydrogen South Africa and Namibia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to contribute to the further development of the green transition in Namibia by showing influentials how the Netherlands approaches this transition.This will be done through related activities:&#x2022;	Field visits to Dutch companies in the Northern, Western and Eastern parts of the Netherlands to understand the energy transition and hydrogen activities;&#x2022;	Interaction with Dutch knowledge institutes and representatives of the triple helix in Energy; and&#x2022;	Knowledge exchanges with officials from different Dutch ministries.These activities will contribute to an improved knowledge on how the Netherlands can play a supporting role and opportunities that exist for partnering between Namibian organisations and the Netherlands.</narrative>
  </description>
